Since I'm one of those people addicted to window-shopping
for a character whose stats meet with my approval (I've
been playing elves but I prefer CO 17+) I'd like to
suggest a new argument for invoking nethack.

Something like nethack -CO 18 -IN 18 would be really nice,
giving me the option to "force" certain stats high while
accpting the necessary reduction in other stats.  Limiting
this to one or two stats would alright but it wouldn't 
seem unreasonable to allow players to "tune" their
characters (think of it as competitive recruiting...)



